{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skybound</strong> offers an intense climbing experience that demands patience, skill, and strategy as you make your way upward.<br>Your goal is simple: <strong>reach the top.</strong> But the path ahead is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the scorching heat of the desert,<br>Survive the deadly traps of lava,<br>Overcome the mysterious obstacles of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome challenges you with unique dangers, and a single mistake can cost you all your progress. To succeed, you must rely on your reflexes, determination, and calm under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer the summit, or will you fall back into the shadows below?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015570?t=1758699996","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015570/e034eef28a25d4010810d5b6cad3435fa0e96620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758699996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015570/fef25239d38f3b900faa99674214994e2e4e3636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758699996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015570/fef25239d38f3b900faa99674214994e2e4e3636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758699996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skybound</strong> offers an intense climbing experience that demands patience, skill, and strategy as you make your way upward.<br>Your goal is simple: <strong>reach the top.</strong> But the path ahead i